# The image installs and builds everything itself. A checkout's node_modules carries THIS
# machine's native bindings (rolldown, lightningcss, tailwind's oxide), and a stale dist would be
# shipped instead of the one the build stage makes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-server
**/.azeroth
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Configuration and state belong to the deployment, never to the image: .env is read at RUN time
# (env_file / --env-file), and the index lives on a volume.
**/.env
**/*.local
**/.data
**/logs

.git
.github
.claude
.playwright-mcp
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
